<view class="page result">
  <view class="result-head">
    <view class="result-kicker">{{summary}}</view>
    <view class="result-title">为你写了三句</view>
    <view class="result-sub">本地模板组合，不是 AI 生成。可以逐句复制，也可以换一组。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="result-list" wx:if="{{results.length}}">
    <view class="result-card" wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="result-top">
        <view class="result-index">0{{index + 1}}</view>
        <view class="result-label">候选 {{index + 1}}</view>
      </view>
      <text class="result-text" user-select="{{true}}">{{item.text}}</text>
      <view class="result-actions">
        <button
          class="btn-copy"
          hover-class="btn-copy--pressed"
          data-index="{{index}}"
          bindtap="onCopy"
        >复制这句</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="result-empty" wx:else>
    <view class="result-empty-title">这次没有组合出合适的句子</view>
    <view class="result-empty-text">可以返回修改，或再换一组试试。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="result-tools">
    <button
      class="btn-primary"
      hover-class="btn-primary--pressed"
      bindtap="onRefresh"
    >换一组</button>
    <button
      class="btn-ghost result-back"
      hover-class="btn-ghost--pressed"
      bindtap="onBackEdit"
    >返回修改</button>
  </view>

  <view
    class="result-teaser"
    hover-class="result-teaser--pressed"
    bindtap="onOpenPro"
    aria-role="button"
    aria-label="高级祝福语"
  >
    <text class="result-teaser-text">想看高级祝福语？点这里查看。</text>
    <text class="result-teaser-arrow">›</text>
  </view>

  <view class="footnote">
    祝福语由本地模板、规则和随机组合生成，未使用 AI；你填写的内容不会上传。
  </view>
</view>
